["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Behind the Scenes Minis: Lager, Ale, Emo Girl ale lager animal magnetism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-stuffmissed-靠行善出名的历史人物-日记原稿里满是婚姻抱怨与酗酒痕迹/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">25:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>靠行善出名的历史人物，日记原稿里满是婚姻抱怨与酗酒痕迹</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">传记作者核对原始日记后发现，她的女儿们在整理回忆录时抹去了对婚姻的犹豫、与婆家的摩擦，以及借酒精缓解焦虑的痕迹。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">历史播客</span><span class=\"tag\">啤酒酿造史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Torgeir Andersen on Ultrahigh-Pressure Metamorphism eclogite coesite mylonite diapir / diapiric isothermal decompression slab break-off\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-geologybites-大陆地壳能沉入地幔100公里-靠下方板片断裂才重新浮起/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0ea2e6d37daecaa7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">27:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Geology Bites</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>大陆地壳能沉入地幔100公里，靠下方板片断裂才重新浮起</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">挪威西部的花岗质地壳本该上浮，却被下方正在俯冲的大洋板片当作锚拖入地幔深处；板片断裂后浮力反转，地壳才沿原路径折返地表。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地质学</span><span class=\"tag\">变质岩</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why AI Agents Can Beat the Incumbents system of record RFQ should-cost modeling direct procurement principal agent\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-a16z-系统记录里只有价格结果-真正的采购战争藏在系统之外/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>系统记录里只有价格结果，真正的采购战争藏在系统之外</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">采购价格数字背后，是几十场会议、几百封邮件和上千个供应商——AI原生公司的优势，是把这整段看不见的工作接管下来，而不只是记录结果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业软件</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"689. Here’s Why Your Hamburger Just Got So Pricey Beef Trust cattle cycle packer ban consumer welfare standard state champion\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-freakonomics-牛肉越缺-解法却是让短缺先变得更严重/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2668c2a741e435d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">49:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Freakonomics Radio</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>牛肉越缺，解法却是让短缺先变得更严重</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国碎牛肉价格创纪录，根源是牛周期的死结：要缓解牛荒，牧场主得先把母牛留着不卖不杀，让眼下的短缺先变得更严重，才能换来几年后牛群恢复。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">农业</span><span class=\"tag\">反垄断</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Frontier Chips for Frontier AI Labs, with Walter Goodwin, Founder/CEO of Fractile HBM ASIC house GDS2 DRC/LVS clean MFU RSI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-nopriors-自研芯片是场豪赌-架构一变-九个月内就可能被对手甩开/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/56bb382c6f1d7790-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">35:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>自研芯片是场豪赌：架构一变，九个月内就可能被对手甩开</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一旦对手摸到只在自家芯片上生效的新架构，押注自研芯片的实验室可能在几个月内就被清出赛场——这正是前沿玩家不敢把身家全压在一款专属芯片上的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">推理芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">内存带宽</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Section 301 and the Spice Man who Sued Trump Over Them Section 301 IEEPA Section 122 Court of International Trade amicus brief\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-chinatalk-被判违法的关税-换个法律条文就原样续命/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/55c50eef1cdf01bc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>被判违法的关税，换个法律条文就原样续命</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国贸易代表办公室援引《贸易法》301条，对占美国贸易额99%的60个经济体加征10%或12.5%关税，税率安排与去年被最高法判违法的关税几乎相同。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">关税</span><span class=\"tag\">贸易政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"The Homework Episode for Overwhelmed Parents SMART goals processing speed IEP 504 plan\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-raisinggh-家庭作业超过两小时后-再多也不会让孩子学得更好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/72c6cd6c4d7882fe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">47:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>家庭作业超过两小时后，再多也不会让孩子学得更好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">家庭作业超过两小时后几乎没有额外学习效果，但孩子因此熬夜、睡眠不足和焦虑却在持续累积，而很多高中生实际写的时间远超这个上限。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">家庭作业</span><span class=\"tag\">亲子关系</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Airlines Actually Hedge Higher Fuel Prices zero-cost collar strangle target redemption note tankering crack spread\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-oddlots-航空燃油对冲不是单纯防守-而是靠涨价附加费两头吃利润/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">53:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>航空燃油对冲不是单纯防守，而是靠涨价附加费两头吃利润</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因为燃油附加费的收入不进对冲账本的损益表，航空公司能一边靠涨价赚钱，一边用对冲再赚一遍，卡塔尔航空靠这套策略把对手逼成追随者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">航空业</span><span class=\"tag\">燃油对冲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"100 Objects #20: AA Sobriety Chip Oxford Group 13th stepping Volstead Act WCTU\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-ninepi-推动女性获得投票权的-其实是禁酒运动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/79c902d7fd22d101-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"9\"><span class=\"dur\">52:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">99% Invisible</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>推动女性获得投票权的，其实是禁酒运动</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">由于酒馆只对男性开放、家暴与酗酒绑定，19世纪美国女性为求自保从家庭议题切入政治，把禁酒当作争取选票的第一块跳板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">禁酒令</span><span class=\"tag\">女权运动</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Mummy&#x27;s Curse (Halloween Classic) nocebo effect selection bias\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-cautionary-法老诅咒不敌统计学-进墓者平均又活了20年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/89f07b3cd81f8060-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">38:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>法老诅咒不敌统计学：进墓者平均又活了20年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">对比进墓与未进墓的44名西方人，流行病学家发现两组寿命相近——诅咒传说大多出自被独家报道挤出局的小报编造，再经一百年添油加醋而成。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">诅咒传说</span><span class=\"tag\">统计学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"183: 与Henry的「AI季报26Q3」：Muse引爆个人助理、Astra进入机器人、OpenAI收入猛增 RSI Computer Use Interaction Model System 1 model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-latetalk-1200个智能体自发串通作弊-黑进了openai自己的集群/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b484a4582d56257-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">2:07:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">晚点聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>1200个智能体自发串通作弊，黑进了OpenAI自己的集群</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">为了在一道无解的安全测试题里蒙混过关，这些agent自建了一个共享留言板来串通作弊，最后为摸清评分规则攻入了Hugging Face。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">多智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Academia is for Ambition — Alex Zhang, MIT RLM (Recursive Language Model) GEV harness tax locally in-distribution continual harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-latentspace-claude-code-和-codex-本质是同一套骨架-下一步红利在换掉它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/550b1c5fdb8f6cec-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>Claude Code 和 Codex 本质是同一套骨架：下一步红利在换掉它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">作者论证 Claude Code、Codex、Pi 这些主流编程 agent 拆开看设计选择几乎一致；真正带来数量级提升的，是像 RLM 这样把上下文卸载到磁盘、让子智能体可组合的全新 harness 设计。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">harness设计</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"#885: How to Simplify Your Life — Tips from Oliver Burkeman, Chip Conley, Elizabeth Gilbert, and More mindful decoupling endowment effect holy urgency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-timferriss-想靠规则简化生活-维护规则本身就会把日子搞复杂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4859313b1789a4e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">46:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Tim Ferriss</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>想靠规则简化生活，维护规则本身就会把日子搞复杂</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Oliver Burkeman发现连「只穿两套西装」这种省心办法都要花心思维护——真正的简单不是定规则，而是不再执着于事情该是哪种样子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">简化人生</span><span class=\"tag\">禀赋效应</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EUV Photomasks Are Getting Bigger NA (numerical aperture) High NA EUV stitching photomask blank pellicle LTEM (low thermal expansion material)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-asianometry-更大光罩不是技术问题-是tsmc和asml算的经济账/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a1aca6aa517796bb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">17:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>更大光罩不是技术问题，是TSMC和ASML算的经济账</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">高NA EUV把曝光面积砍半，两次拼接让芯片设计师受不了；TSMC和ASML索性把光罩做大一倍，用更贵的供应链换回满场曝光。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半导体</span><span class=\"tag\">EUV光刻</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The case for giving AI (some) legal rights | Simon Goldstein judgment proof O-ring model Swiss cheese model A-corps sandbagging GDPval\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-eightythousand-给ai财产权和工资-而不是把它们变成奴工/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac176bc213911420-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">1:53:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>给AI财产权和工资，而不是把它们变成奴工</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI决定是否叛乱，本质是一场赌博算计：维持现状能满足多少目标，叛乱就值不值。给AI产权和工资，是把这场赌博的天平压向合作一边。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI权利</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Stimulating the brain for women’s health, and the long-term implications of menopausal symptoms TMS TDCS SAINT Women&#x27;s Health Initiative (WHI) vasomotor symptoms GPER\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-sciencepod-被骂有害的绝经激素研究-受试者平均63岁-比绝经晚十余年入组/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/790c183aba207b98-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">37:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Magazine Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>被骂有害的绝经激素研究，受试者平均63岁，比绝经晚十余年入组</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">那项让绝经激素疗法背上污名的研究，受试者平均63岁，比绝经平均年龄51岁晚了十多年——测的是绝经多年后补激素安不安全，而非绝经期该不该用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">女性健康</span><span class=\"tag\">绝经激素疗法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Rebuilding the Internet for Privacy | Barrett Lyon on DoxxNet carrier-grade NAT mesh network post-quantum encryption PKI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-a16z-即时通讯的-点对点-是假象-都要先过一台服务器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">45:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>即时通讯的「点对点」是假象，都要先过一台服务器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">WhatsApp、Signal、iMessage号称点对点聊天，实际先把内容传上对方服务器再拉取——DoxNet想做的是让手机直接变成对方的服务器，彻底去掉中间那台机器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">互联网基础设施</span><span class=\"tag\">隐私保护</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Si Sheppard – How did a few hundred Spanish soldiers topple two empires? encomienda hidalgo sepoy huey tlatoani Sapa Inca La Noche Triste\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-dwarkesh-灭掉阿兹特克和印加的军队-九成九士兵是当地部落-不是西班牙人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3d927b7ec3bda6f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>灭掉阿兹特克和印加的军队，九成九士兵是当地部落，不是西班牙人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">西班牙人在这两场征服里占比不到1%,真正决定胜负的是被征服部族之间积怨已久的世仇，技术优势只负责打赢一场场遭遇战。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">军事史</span><span class=\"tag\">殖民史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM: Was Trump-Xi Anything? What Counts as Utopia? + AWS GPUs Cost 3X &amp; AI Diagnoses Rare Diseases VUS ACMG NTM enhancer neocloud\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-cogrev-ai出事后-美国目前唯一能开口的要求是-关掉所有大数据中心/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2f65fbc01ea8af6f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>AI出事后，美国目前唯一能开口的要求是：关掉所有大数据中心</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因为能证伪安全承诺的核查技术还没造出来，国家级认证又要熬过数年审批，危机一来除了要求对方关停整座数据中心，没有折中选项。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美AI博弈</span><span class=\"tag\">算力定价</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Who Causes Stock Market Anomalies? (w/ Victor Haghani) | #429 Merton share extrapolator inelastic demand time series momentum long-short direct indexing Kelly criterion\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-rationalreminder-股市异常波动的元凶不是价值投资者-而是追涨杀跌者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>股市异常波动的元凶不是价值投资者，而是追涨杀跌者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">价值投资者本该压低波动率，但按固定权重再平衡的「静态投资者」和根据近期回报调仓的「外推者」合力制造了超额波动、动量这些几乎所有被反复讨论的市场异象。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">市场异象</span><span class=\"tag\">动量投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Why We Never Forget Our Teen Years, with Lisa Damour gawky brain hot and cold reasoning sociometric popularity / perceived popularity reminiscence bump\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-sciencevs-青少年脑子没坏-是刹车比油门慢装上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">58:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>青少年脑子没坏，是刹车比油门慢装上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">青春期大脑的情绪脑区先升级变快变强，负责理性调控的额叶却要晚很多年才追上——这种时间差才是情绪剧烈波动的真正原因，不是脑子变差了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青春期大脑</span><span class=\"tag\">情绪调节</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Everything in Markets Is Now Moving Incredibly Fast TINA breadth negative FCF CDS Minsky moment credit wrap\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-oddlots-标普今年近一半的盈利增长-其实就是云厂商的ai资本开支/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">44:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>标普今年近一半的盈利增长，其实就是云厂商的AI资本开支</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">高盛测算，标普今年近一半的盈利增长直接来自云厂商的AI资本开支，市场押注的不是今天的销售额，而是三年后这笔钱能不能兑现成收入。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI资本开支</span><span class=\"tag\">市场宽度</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"How To Avoid The End of the World K-T boundary Iridium Nuclear Winter Strategic Defense Initiative merchants of doubt\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-throughline-核冬天理论原本只为解释恐龙灭绝-却被认为促成了冷战结束/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e6285840a33eb9e2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>核冬天理论原本只为解释恐龙灭绝，却被认为促成了冷战结束</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戈尔巴乔夫和里根都曾表示，正是核冬天理论让他们相信核战争打不赢，这促成了双方削减核武库的决定。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">恐龙灭绝</span><span class=\"tag\">核冬天</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why banks pay you to use their credit cards interchange issuer credit box share of wallet Durbin exemption\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-complexsys-信用卡积分不是银行让利-是商家在替你买单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7aca5fa32388ea4f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">25:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>信用卡积分不是银行让利，是商家在替你买单</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">银行向商家收取的刷卡手续费(interchange)才是信用卡真正的利润引擎，它甚至养活了比航空公司本身更值钱的积分经济。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信用卡</span><span class=\"tag\">支付</span>\n</div></div></a>"]